    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0fe414b2f42ee7a36ae7de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那时我恍然大悟。\n荒漠英雄一定是到了今天，\n经过德比这篇“故事”后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6f68dfdf29dd998856ad3642f5097edb9b73f8ef4674a1faeb451cf0b41ef09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
