    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ba6c38680e5917fb2bfdf0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "才终于认可了自己，\n才相信了自己就是英雄传说的主角……\n相信自己有朝一日将成为真正的英雄吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c88aa4b425a3d5be03ab08d8fa25595bdc46eb6f6449c4f99bb5c05f381437a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
